    {
      "text": "because of the stiffneckedness of Laman, 1 Ne. 2:11. after they have … stiffened their necks, 2 Ne. 6:10. they at Jerusalem will stiffen their necks against him, 2 Ne. 10:5. They wear stiff necks and high heads, 2 Ne. 28:14 (Jacob 2:13). mourn because of the … stiffneckedness of men, 2 Ne. 32:7. Jews were a stiffnecked people, Jacob 4:14. stiffnecked and a gainsaying people, Jacob 6:4. stiffnecked people, hard to understand, Enos 1:22. not stiffnecked and have faith, Jarom 1:4. use much sharpness because of the stiffneckedness, W of M 1:17. stiffnecked people, quick to do iniquity, Mosiah 13:29. hard-hearted and a stiffnecked people, Alma 9:5 (15:15; 20:30). as stiffnecked a people as they are, Alma 26:24. our stiffnecked brethren, the Nephites, Alma 37:10. had been a stiffnecked people, Hel. 4:21. because of stiffneckedness and unbelief, 3 Ne. 15:18. stiffnecked people, why have ye built up churches, Morm. 8:33.",
